# Keep the docker build context lean. The Dockerfile only COPYs ./oracle-build/*
# (staged by build-image.sh) and ./oracle_shim.py — everything else here (.venv,
# logs, pycache, the gpu_worker/diffgemma_common bundled SEPARATELY by `flash
# deploy`, scorecards, build logs) is irrelevant to the image and bloats the
# context (the dir is ~900 MB, mostly .venv).
*
!oracle-build/
!oracle_shim.py
